Upstream attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a DeepSeek Harness-native port of the Harness-of-Harness core
loop. The loop it ports — deterministic Planner/Developer/Tester sequencing, the
per-event runtime receipt, the reproducibility record, and repair-then-next
iterations — is implemented in HoH-lite:

  HoH-lite (https://github.com/Flesymeb/HarnessOfHarness)
  Copyright 2026 HoH-lite contributors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Its license and notices are retained upstream and apply to that separate work.

  The upstream repository carries two licences. Its paper and demo materials at
  the repository root are MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Hyoung Yan; the hoh-lite/
  source tree this project ports is the Apache-2.0 work credited above.

No HoH-lite source file is copied into this package: the upstream loop is Python
and this port is JavaScript, and the role prompts, record writers, and engine are
independent implementations. The mechanisms they implement are derived from
HoH-lite, which is why this project carries the same license.

See docs/alignment-with-upstream-hoh.md for the item-by-item record of which
upstream mechanisms are reproduced, which are improved on, and which are
deliberately out of scope.

